175 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 151 0 R
/E (I chose Kundapur because of its large fishing and boat building community, some of whom trace their families back to Goa. That community gave me something concrete to study on the ground, rather than starting from an abstract question.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
176 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 151 0 R
/E (My first idea was to look at how these communities choose sites to shelter their boats, weighing easy access to the sea against shelter from storms. The plan was to visit several boatyard sites, record their locations, and compare how each one handled that trade off. It felt like a strong starting point. A clear, physical question that I could walk to, photograph, and ask people about directly.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
177 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 151 0 R
/E (02)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
