362 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 164 0 R
/E (What draws me in is that this project did not start from a plan I set out with. It grew out of paying close attention to a place that kept refusing to sit still. That interest only grew stronger the more I checked it against research and against the people who actually live and work there.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
363 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 164 0 R
/E (I am curious to see whether the pattern I noticed on the ground, in moss, clay, tides and a fixed marker tied to moving water, actually shows up in the satellite record too. To look into that, I want to map it out properly using a GIS tool, and spend time exploring the satellite imagery itself, including Google Earth Pro, to see if the visual and spatial evidence matches what I observed firsthand. )
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
